        <h3 class="h4">Asset tracking &amp; reliability engineering</h3>
        <p class="card-body">Every pump, compressor, valve, and vessel in one live registry — ID, location, and custody history in an immutable record. Run hours and condition readings roll up into MTBF and OEE. Criticality ranking puts attention where downtime costs most.</p>
        <p class="marker-note">Ranked by asset criticality</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--surface card--numbered">
        <p class="card-kicker">02</p>
        <h3 class="h4">Emissions monitoring &amp; LDAR</h3>
        <p class="card-body">Method 21 and Optical Gas Imaging surveys captured in the field — timestamped, geotagged, tied to the component, with emission factor and leak duration. Package into annual GHG, ESG, and rolling-12 reporting.</p>
        <p class="marker-note">Mapped to NSPS OOOOb and state rules</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--surface card--numbered">
        <p class="card-kicker">03</p>
        <h3 class="h4">Asset retirement &amp; remediation</h3>
        <p class="card-body">One record through decommissioning, dismantling, and remediation — wells, facilities, tanks, and pipelines. Custody and condition from soil sampling to closeout. Abandonment and restoration requirements map to state and federal rules.</p>
        <p class="marker-note">Mapped to site closure &amp; remediation</p>
      </div>
